WEBVTT

00:04:28.246 --> 00:04:30.621
But if big data 
has been around for so long,

00:04:30.663 --> 00:04:33.454
why do we suddenly
keep hearing about it now?

00:04:33.663 --> 00:04:35.996
Well, as the old metaphor explains,

00:04:36.038 --> 00:04:38.288
the whole is greater
than the sum of its parts,

00:04:38.329 --> 00:04:41.746
and this is no longer just science
that is exploiting this.

00:04:43.246 --> 00:04:45.246
The fact that we can derive more knowledge

00:04:45.288 --> 00:04:48.704
by joining related information together
and spotting correlations

00:04:48.746 --> 00:04:52.454
can inform and enrich numerous
aspects of everyday life,

00:04:52.496 --> 00:04:55.996
either in real-time,
such as traffic or financial conditions,

00:04:56.038 --> 00:05:00.704
in short-term evolutions,
such as medical or meteorological,